  gggggggggggddsSSSSSSSSSSSSSSSSSS
  gggggggggggddsSEEEEEEEEEEEEEEEEE
  gggggggggggddsSE....ff........ff
  gggggggggggddsSE................
  gggggggggggddsSE................
  gggggggggggddsSE................
  gggggggggggddsSE................
  gggggggggggddsSE................
  gggggggggggddsSE................
